    "synthesis_process": "Authored from a named industrial control scenario; fixed interface, priority, scan convention, boundary tests and LTL obligations were designed together.",
    "adaptations": "Deterministic I/O abstraction; no physical I/O addressing or online control.",
    "rationale": "Redundant sensor voting is a common PLC control pattern; explicit limits make the task testable.",
